description	"Jango Fett [Mandalorian]

The greatest bounty hunter in the galaxy during his day, boasting a jetpack, a grappling hook, an armblade, fast dual pistols, damage resistances, and a slew of offensive gadgets.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
- Beskar Armblade (Cyan)
-- Saber Chain Limit: 2
-- Saber Damage (80)
-- Saber Defense (1)
-- Blaster Defense (0)
- Wrist Flamethrower (Thrower)
-- 20% slower RoF
-- 90x longer reload
- Wrist Rockets (5)(Rocket Launcher 3)
-- 70% faster velocity
-- 35% less dmg
-- 170% longer reload
-- Alt-fire only
-- Staggers on hit
- WESTAR-34 Blaster Pistols (3)
-- 5% faster RoF
-- 5% faster velocity
-- 5% more dmg
-- 5% more FP dmg
-- 65% slower reload

^6Inventory:
- Binoculars
- Medpac

^8Attributes:
- 20% less KB taken
- 20% less KB given
- 50% slower skill cooldown
- Beskar (3)
- Dexterity (3)
- Blast Armor
- Healing (1)
- Tracking Beacon
- Anti-Mind Trick (1)

^3Abilities:
- Jetpack
- Rocket ^3[CS1*]
- Poison + Tracking Darts (6) ^3[CS2*]
- Gun Kick ^3[CS3*]
- Wrist Laser ^3[CS4]
- Grappling Hook (1) ^3[CS4 Melee*]
-- Pulls/disarms/cripples on hit"
